flowchart LR
 GH[GitHub repository] --> CI[CI: lint test build]
 CI --> W[Windows build + signing]
 CI --> M[macOS build + notarization]
 CI --> L[Linux package build]
 W --> REL[Release artifacts]
 M --> REL
 L --> REL
 REL --> USERS[User installs locally]
 USERS --> LOCAL[Local STT / TTS / avatar / OS broker]
 LOCAL <--> CLOUD[Optional cloud LLM API]
